Swift 1.5 continues UkisAI's Swift 1.0 model, itself a Qwen3.8-27B
derivative. The full release incorporates the Qwen3.8-27B Base Model and
UkisAI's Swift 1.0 and Swift 1.5 contributions.

Changes made by UkisAI (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b) change notice):
  - model-*.safetensors, model.safetensors.index.json: the model weights from
    Swift 1.0 were further adapted by UkisAI using additional post-training
    methods.
  - README.md: replaced. LICENSE and NOTICE added.
  - All other files (config.json, generation_config.json, chat_template.jinja,
    tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json, vocab.json, merges.txt,
    preprocessor_config.json, video_preprocessor_config.json) are retained from
    the parent model and remain available under Apache License, Version 2.0.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes in this redistribution (2026-10-01)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an unofficial community redistribution. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by UkisAI or Alibaba Cloud.

  Copyright 2026 UkisAI. Swift Contribution licensed under the Swift Open
  License v1.0 (https://huggingface.co/ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b/blob/main/LICENSE).
  Derivative of Qwen3.8-27B, Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud, Apache License 2.0.

Files changed or added relative to ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b:

  - Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-A-outQ6_K.gguf
    Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-B-outQ8_0.gguf
    Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-C-outQ4_K.gguf
    The upstream BF16 model-*.safetensors weights were converted to a BF16
    GGUF with llama.cpp's convert_hf_to_gguf.py (--outtype bf16; the MTP /
    nextn layer was kept, 866 tensors), then quantized with llama.cpp
    llama-quantize (build 11214, commit 2ebd9ae62) to MXFP4 for the large
    matrices, Q8_0 for token_embd, ssm_alpha, ssm_beta and the whole MTP layer
    (blk.64), and Q6_K / Q8_0 / Q4_K respectively for the output head. Norms
    and other small tensors are F32. An importance matrix published by
    bartowski (ukisai_Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-imatrix.gguf) was passed to
    llama-quantize. The tokenizer and chat template were embedded into the
    GGUF metadata by the conversion script.
  - mmproj-Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-F16.gguf: the vision encoder / projector,
    converted from the same BF16 weights with convert_hf_to_gguf.py
    (--mmproj --outtype f16), without further quantization.
  - README.md: replaced with a model card describing these quantized files.
  - NOTICE: this section appended.
  - LICENSE and LICENSE-APACHE-2.0: unmodified copies of the upstream files.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes in this redistribution (2026-10-19 rebuild)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-A-outQ6_K.gguf
    Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-B-outQ8_0.gguf
    Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-MXFP4-C-outQ4_K.gguf
    Re-made from the same upstream BF16 weights (ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b,
    revision b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4; weights unchanged since
    the initial release) with llama.cpp build b11719 (commit 5aeac37a3):
    convert_hf_to_gguf.py --outtype bf16 (866 tensors, MTP layer kept), then
    llama-quantize built from that commit plus mxfp4_wsearch.patch (an
    importance-matrix-weighted search of the MXFP4 block scale; quantize-time
    code only, standard MXFP4 output). Same tensor types as the 2026-10-01
    files: MXFP4 for the large matrices of the 64 main layers, Q8_0 for
    token_embd, ssm_alpha, ssm_beta and the MTP layer (blk.64), Q6_K / Q8_0 /
    Q4_K for the output head, F32 for norms and small tensors. Importance
    matrix: ukisai_Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-imatrix.gguf by bartowski
    (bartowski/ukisai_Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-GGUF, revision
    ce202c7d9a5d71969c60bf62a4f1c3e41747520c, SHA256
    125d4e6838a1a62cabf9c48aebdfa47e497e95db590a993ee94e12aaf28a268b).
  - mxfp4_wsearch.patch: added (the quantizer change, a diff against
    llama.cpp 5aeac37a3, ggml/src/ggml-quants.c; llama.cpp is MIT-licensed).
  - RECIPE.md, SOURCE_SHA256.txt, SHA256SUMS: added (reproduction commands,
    source file hashes, hashes of the files in this repository).
  - README.md: updated for the rebuild.
  - mmproj-Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-F16.gguf, LICENSE, LICENSE-APACHE-2.0:
    unchanged.
